<title>USA: Dow index up more than 50 points.</title>
<headline>Dow index up more than 50 points.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average gained more than 50 points in mid-morning trading Tuesday as the market tracked a rebound in bonds.</p>
<p>At 10:44 a.m. EDT/1444 GMT, the Dow was up 51.33 points at 7,958.05, which activated the New York Stock Exchange's limits on program trading.</p>
